er":"unstudied"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:019-asparagus-sparagus-or-sperage":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Asparagus, Sparagus, Or Sperage","headword":"Asparagus, Sparagus, Or Sperage","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"They are both under the dominion of Jupiter. The young buds or branches boiled in ordinary broth, make the belly soluble and open, and boiled in white wine, provoke urine, being stopped, and is good against the stranguary or difficulty of making water; it expelleth the gravel and stone out of the kidneys, and helpeth pains in the reins. And boiled in white wine or vinegar, it is prevalent for them that have their arteries loosened, or are troubled with the hip-gout or sciatica. The decoction of the roots boiled in wine and taken, is good to clear the sight, and being held in the mouth easeth the toothache. The garden asparagus nourisheth more than the wild, yet hath it the same effects in all the afore-mentioned diseases. The decoction of the root in white wine, and the back and belly bathed therewith, or kneeling or lying down in the same, or sitting therein as a bath, has been found effectual against pains of the reins and bladder, pains of the mother and cholic, and generally against all pains that happen to the lower parts of the body, and no less effectual against stiff and benumbed sinews, or those that are shrunk by cramps and convulsions, and helps the sciatica.","spans":[{"start":157,"end":170,"concept_id":"diuresis","polarity":"action"},{"start":211,"end":221,"concept_id":"dysuria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":225,"end":251,"concept_id":"dysuria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":270,"end":276,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":281,"end":286,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":298,"end":305,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":332,"end":337,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":461,"end":469,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":473,"end":481,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":547,"end":562,"concept_id":"eye_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":603,"end":612,"concept_id":"toothache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":929,"end":934,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":939,"end":946,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":957,"end":967,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":972,"end":978,"concept_id":"colic","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1086,"end":1111,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1141,"end":1147,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1152,"end":1163,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1179,"end":1187,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"cul:019-asparagus-sparagus-or-sperage":{"157":"provokes urine: diuretic","211":"strangury (stranguary): slow, painful urination","225":"heat / sharpness of urine; difficulty of making water","270":"gravel: small urinary concretions","281":"the stone (urinary calculus)","298":"kidneys","332":"reins: kidneys","461":"hip-gout: sciatica","473":"sciatica","547":"clears / sharpens / strengthens the sight","603":"tooth-ache","929":"reins: kidneys","939":"bladder","957":"the mother: the womb (fits, rising, suffocation, pains of the mother)","972":"cholic: colic, griping abdominal pain","1086":"stiff sinews","1141":"cramp, cramps","1152":"convulsions","1179":"sciatica"}},"images":[]}